    <item>
      <title>Rabbit R1陨落启示录：AI硬件的“先烈”困境与具身智能的未来图景</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/rabbit-r1ai-20251127204006106-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 27 Nov 2025 20:40:06 +0800</pubDate>
